# Raw per-replicate simulation output. Regenerable: the study scripts use
# fixed seeds, so re-running reproduces them exactly. Committing them would
# add ~3.8 MB per version to history permanently, and .rds does not
# delta-compress. Summary CSVs and generated findings ARE tracked.
studies/runs/**/*.rds
